@Sagrisa.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5201

### 1. Diagnóstico de API (Health Check & Test Probe)
GET {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/test
Accept: application/json

### 2. Autenticación (Login con DUI + PIN)
# @name login
POST {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dui": "00123456-7",
  "pin": "77777"
}

### Extraer Token JWT
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Perfil de Usuario Autenticado (/api/auth/me)
GET {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Catálogo de Clientes (Paginado & Búsqueda)
GET {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/clientes?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/C001
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Catálogo de Productos (Paginado & Filtro Familia)
GET {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/productos?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&soloActivos=true
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/productos/P001
Accept: application/json

### 6. Módulo de Pedidos (Consulta & Creación)
GET {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/pedidos?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/pedidos/00012345
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear Pedido Nuevo
POST {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/pedidos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codCliente": "C001",
  "codVendedor": "GTCMARCOS",
  "tpago": "Credito",
  "observacion": "Entrega express en sucursal",
  "direccionEntrega": "Calle Principal #123, San Salvador",
  "detalles": [
    {
      "codProducto": "P001",
      "cantidad": 5,
      "bodega": "B01"
    },
    {
      "codProducto": "P002",
      "cantidad": 10,
      "bodega": "B01"
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Webhook de Supabase (Sincronización de Pedido)
POST {{Sagrisa.API_HostAddress}}/api/webhooks/supabase/order-created
X-Webhook-Secret: sagrissa-webhook-secret-2026
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "INSERT",
  "table": "orders",
  "schema": "public",
  "record": {
    "numPedido": "00012345",
    "codCliente": "C001",
    "codVendedor": "GTCMARCOS",
    "totalPedido": 262.50
  }
}
